    "created_at": "2023-04-21T09:20:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-04-21T09:24:54Z",
    "body": "I think the main thing we want to do here is to change \"this's MIME type\" to be more obviously an algorithm invocation. I think that would address any potential confusion. But this would be an editorial change as in principle this already makes the relevant requirements.",
